#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:5
#: d3e36dfc1bbc497d8ef2ba4b6a113c94
msgid "HC-SR04 Sonar Rangefinder"
msgstr "HC-SR04 声呐测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:7
#: 2292f39489794e97a2d9e3b46caa89f5
msgid ""
"The HC-SR04 sonar is an inexpensive but short range (only up to 2m) range "
"finder primarily designed for indoor use but which has been successfully "
"used outdoors on Copter. The very short range makes it of limited use."
msgstr ""
"HC-SR04 声呐是一款廉价但短程（最远仅 2m）的测距仪，主要设计用于室内，也已成功用于 Copter 的室外场景。极短的量程使其用途受限。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:15
#: 62bc375ab81d4a139db225165e059318
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` must be set to a tested, appropriate value.  If "
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` is set to a value  greater than 2m, the autopilot will not "
"respond correctly to the data provided."
msgstr ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 必须设置为经过测试的适当值。如果 ``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 设置为超过 2m "
"的值，飞控将无法正确响应所提供的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:18
#: e7d2641ab4724b2bbb71501834af65bc
msgid "Connection to the autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:20
#: a26feb99039e407eb5b9b0a12101e92c
msgid ""
"Two :ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>` are required for the Trigger pin (starts the"
" sonar pulse) and Echo pin (indicates reception of the echo). These can be a"
" PWM output if the ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` is set such that two are available, or "
"if the autopilot has dedicated GPIO outputs (see the autopilot's "
":ref:`description <common-autopilots>` or datasheet)."
msgstr ""
"触发引脚（启动声呐脉冲）和回波引脚（指示接收到回波）各需要一个 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`。如果 "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` 设置为使两个 PWM 输出可用，或者飞控有专用 GPIO 输出（请参阅飞控的 :ref:`说明 <common-"
"autopilots>` 或数据手册），则可以使用 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:22
#: 89c9a71fa89f43dca9836eff829b6102
msgid ""
"in firmware versions 4.2 and later, the method for setting a PWM/SERVO/MOTOR"
" output to be a GPIO function is changed. Instead of ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` being"
" used, the individual ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter is merely set to \"-1\"."
" If set to \"0\", it remains a PWM output, unassigned to a function, and "
"outputs that output's trim value when board safety is not active. If the "
"servo function is being \"mirrored\" to a remote device, as in the case of a"
" DroneCAN or KDECAN ESC, then in order to change the autopilot board's "
"corresponding output pin to be a GPIO, but allow the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to "
"still be assigned to the remote device, the "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` parameter can be used to assign the "
"board pin to be a GPIO without affecting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` assignment "
"for the remote device."
msgstr ""
"在 4.2 及更高版本固件中，将 PWM/SERVO/MOTOR 输出设置为 GPIO 功能的方法已更改。不再使用 "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT``，而是将单独的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数设置为「-1」。如果设置为「0」，则仍然是 PWM "
"输出，未分配功能，在飞控安全未激活时输出该输出的微调值。如果舵机功能被「镜像」到远程设备（如 DroneCAN 或 KDECAN "
"ESC），则为了将飞控板对应的输出引脚更改为 GPIO，同时允许 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 仍分配给远程设备，可以使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` 参数将板引脚分配为 GPIO，而不影响远程设备的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:24
#: 1142d3d2f6b24defba97da7fa1db2958
msgid "To setup as the first rangefinder. Reboot after setting parameters:"
msgstr "设置为第一个测距仪。设置参数后重启："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:26
#: 4612848e36a945eaaacc563cfa515dd4
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = \"2\" (i.e. 2m max range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 「2」（即最大量程 2m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:27
#: 8534e95f00c34ff59a9f89e475b217f0
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = \"0.2\" (i.e. 0.2m min range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = 「0.2」（即最小量程 0.2m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:28
#: 84286a0b3f984281afda4365bd5c14f5
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = Enter GPIO number for pin "
"attached to HC-SRO4 \"Trigger\" pin. For example, on PixHawk with "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` = 4, AUX6 (GPIO 55) could be used here, and AUX5 (GPIO54) "
"could be used below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = 输入连接到 HC-SR04「Trigger」引脚的 GPIO "
"编号。例如，在 Pixhawk 上 ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` = 4 时，可在此使用 AUX6（GPIO "
"55），AUX5（GPIO54）可用于下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:29
#: ca3cc0dad35742ba9dd470d20a687a28
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = Enter GPIO number for pin attached to HC-"
"SRO4 \"Echo\" pin."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = 输入连接到 HC-SR04「Echo」引脚的 GPIO 编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:30
#: 74c55c53ed51426a891cd29f6e7e4a82
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “30\" (HC-SR04 sonar)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「30」（HC-SR04 声呐）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:31
#: e215678b06ba4bce90ca1e664b6c248e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = \"25\" (Downward facing) if used for"
" altitude control."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 「25」（朝下安装），如果用于高度控制。"
